{start_of_verse}
[C]Fresh laid concrete [Dm]
[Am]Melodies blowing [F]
[C]Don't care where we're going [Dm]
[Am]But the day is wasting [F]
[Am]Just keep moving [G]
And take it [F]all in
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
